# 20. Future Enhancements & Cutting-Edge Improvements

Logistic Regression itself is a classical algorithm, but modern ML systems improve around it using:

### 🔹 Regularization

- L1 Regularization → Lasso-style sparsity
- L2 Regularization → Ridge-style coefficient shrinkage
- Elastic Net → Combination

